<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>📊 Movie Ratings Dashboard - 文件导航</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            color: #333;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        
        .header p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }
        
        .nav-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .nav-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            height: 100%;
        }
        
        .nav-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        
        .nav-card.primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .nav-card.secondary {
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
        }
        
        .nav-icon {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .nav-title {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .nav-desc {
            font-size: 0.95em;
            opacity: 0.8;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        
        .nav-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: auto;
        }
        
        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
            color: #667eea;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .nav-card.primary .tag {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .action-section {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .section-title {
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .steps {
            display: grid;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .step {
            padding: 15px;
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        
        .step-num {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        
        .step-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .step-desc {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            margin-left: 40px;
        }
        
        code {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            color: #d63384;
        }
        
        .feature-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .feature {
            padding: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f0f0 0%, #fff 100%);
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        }
        
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }
        
        .back-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .back-button:hover {
            background: #764ba2;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎬 Movie Ratings Dashboard</h1>
            <p>完整的电影数据可视化仪表板</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 快速开始 -->
        <div class="action-section">
            <div class="section-title">🚀 快速开始</div>
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-num">1</span>
                    <div class="step-title">选择打开方式</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">
                        ① 直接双击 <code>index_v2.html</code> 或<br>
                        ② 双击 <code>start-server.bat</code> 或<br>
                        ③ 命令行运行 <code>python -m http.server 8000</code>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-num">2</span>
                    <div class="step-title">加载数据</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">
                        点击 "Load demo" 查看示例，或<br>
                        点击 "Choose a CSV file" 加载你的数据
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-num">3</span>
                    <div class="step-title">开始探索</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">
                        使用过滤器、查看图表、浏览数据表格
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 核心功能 -->
        <div class="action-section">
            <div class="section-title">✨ 核心功能</div>
            <div class="feature-list">
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><span class="feature-icon">📊</span> <strong>静态图表</strong></div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #666;">热力图和词云</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><span class="feature-icon">🔍</span> <strong>智能过滤</strong></div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #666;">6+ 维度过滤</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><span class="feature-icon">📈</span> <strong>数据分析</strong></div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #666;">KPI 统计</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><span class="feature-icon">⚡</span> <strong>快速响应</strong></div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #666;">零外部依赖</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 文件导航 -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div class="section-title" style="color: white; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                📁 文件导航与资源
            </div>
            
            <div class="nav-grid">
                <!-- 主网页 -->
                <a href="index_v2.html" class="nav-card primary">
                    <div class="nav-icon">🌐</div>
                    <div class="nav-title">主网页</div>
                    <div class="nav-desc">打开完整的电影数据可视化仪表板</div>
                    <div class="nav-tags">
                        <span class="tag">index_v2.html</span>
                        <span class="tag">必打开</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                
                <!-- 预览页 -->
                <a href="preview.html" class="nav-card secondary">
                    <div class="nav-icon">👁️</div>
                    <div class="nav-title">预览页</div>
                    <div class="nav-desc">查看图表加载情况，验证系统就绪</div>
                    <div class="nav-tags">
                        <span class="tag">preview.html</span>
                        <span class="tag">可选</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                
                <!-- 快速指南 -->
                <a href="QUICKSTART.md" class="nav-card secondary">
                    <div class="nav-icon">⚡</div>
                    <div class="nav-title">快速入门</div>
                    <div class="nav-desc">3 步快速开始使用网页</div>
                    <div class="nav-tags">
                        <span class="tag">QUICKSTART.md</span>
                        <span class="tag">推荐阅读</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                
                <!-- 详细文档 -->
                <a href="README.md" class="nav-card secondary">
                    <div class="nav-icon">📖</div>
                    <div class="nav-title">详细文档</div>
                    <div class="nav-desc">完整的功能说明和使用指南</div>
                    <div class="nav-tags">
                        <span class="tag">README.md</span>
                        <span class="tag">深入学习</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                
                <!-- 设置说明 -->
                <a href="SETUP.md" class="nav-card secondary">
                    <div class="nav-icon">⚙️</div>
                    <div class="nav-title">设置概览</div>
                    <div class="nav-desc">整体概览、文件结构、常见问题</div>
                    <div class="nav-tags">
                        <span class="tag">SETUP.md</span>
                        <span class="tag">参考</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                
                <!-- CSV 数据 -->
                <div class="nav-card secondary">
                    <div class="nav-icon">📊</div>
                    <div class="nav-title">数据文件</div>
                    <div class="nav-desc">包含 1500+ 部电影的数据集</div>
                    <div class="nav-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Data_merged_cleaned.csv</span>
                        <span class="tag">数据</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 文件清单 -->
        <div class="action-section">
            <div class="section-title">📦 完整文件清单</div>
            
            <div style="columns: 2; gap: 20px;">
                <div>
                    <h3 style="color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 10px;">🌐 网页文件</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ index_v2.html</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ app_v2.js</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ style_v2.css</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <h3 style="color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 10px;">📊 数据和图表</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ Data_merged_cleaned.csv</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ figures/genre_rating_comparison.png</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ figures/wordcloud.png</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <h3 style="color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 10px;">📖 文档</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ README.md</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ QUICKSTART.md</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ SETUP.md</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <h3 style="color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 10px;">🛠️ 工具</h3>
                    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ start-server.bat</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ preview.html</li>
                        <li style="padding: 5px 0;">✓ index.html (旧版)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 技术栈 -->
        <div class="action-section">
            <div class="section-title">🛠️ 技术栈</div>
            <div class="feature-list">
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><strong>技术</strong>: HTML5 + CSS3 + Vanilla JS</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><strong>依赖</strong>: 零外部依赖 (自包含)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><strong>大小</strong>: < 100KB (包含所有资源)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div><strong>兼容性</strong>: Chrome 60+, Firefox 55+, Safari 12+</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 页脚 -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>✨ Movie Ratings Dashboard - 展示您的数据分析 ✨</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 10px; opacity: 0.8;">准备好了吗？现在就点击 <a href="index_v2.html" style="color: white; text-decoration: underline;">主网页</a> 开始吧！🚀</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
